# <%= @name %>

An ECR web application generated by Amber CLI for Amber `2.0.0-beta.1`.

## Run it

```bash
shards install
crystal spec
amber watch
```

Open <http://127.0.0.1:3000> and
<http://127.0.0.1:3000/css/app.css>.

The generated application intentionally includes no ORM or database driver.
Persistence, authentication, API-resource, and native generators are preview
surfaces during this beta. Add those dependencies only by following their own
release documentation.

## Production configuration

Set at least `AMBER_SERVER_SECRET_KEY_BASE`. Set `AMBER_DATABASE_URL` after an
ORM and database driver have been added. See the
[Amber V2 beta guide](https://github.com/amberframework/amber/blob/v2.0.0-beta.1/docs/beta-installation.md).

## Tests

```bash
crystal spec
```
